     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nMetformin 1700 mg three times daily comes to 5,100 mg/day. That's twice the usual maximum of 2,550 mg/day for immediate-release metformin, which is 850 mg three times daily. Doses that high raise the risk of serious lactic acidosis and GI toxicity.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals** (2,550 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1,700 mg/day total**, for example 850 mg twice daily or about 567 mg three times daily\n- Another dose or frequency\n\nTell me the dose you want, or confirm that 1700 mg three times daily is intended, and I'll enter it. If you confirm that dose, I'd suggest adding a note to the order saying it was verified."
      }
